---@field StatusMessage? aws.ec2.String A message providing additional details about the current status of the monitored tag key.
---@field CapacityManagerProvided? aws.ec2.Boolean Indicates whether this tag key is provided by Capacity Manager by default, rather than being user-activated.
---@field EarliestDatapointTimestamp? aws.ec2.MillisecondDateTime The earliest timestamp from which tag data is available for queries, in UTC ISO 8601 format.

---@alias aws.ec2.CapacityManagerMonitoredTagKeyList aws.ec2.CapacityManagerMonitoredTagKey[]

---@alias aws.ec2.CapacityManagerMonitoredTagKeyStatus "activating"|"activated"|"deactivating"|"suspended"

---@alias aws.ec2.CapacityManagerStatus "enabled"|"disabled"

---The supportability score for a single instance type and Availability Zone combination.
---@class aws.ec2.CapacityManagerSupportabilityScore
