---@field AvailabilityZoneId? aws.ec2.AvailabilityZoneId The ID of the Availability Zone.
---@field Score? aws.ec2.SupportabilityScore How well the combination can support the requested capacity right now. high means that the combination holds several times the requested amount. medium means that it can cover the request with little to spare. low means that it holds less than the requested amount.

---@alias aws.ec2.CapacityManagerSupportabilityScoreSet aws.ec2.CapacityManagerSupportabilityScore[]

