---@field EndDateType? aws.ec2.String Indicates the way in which the Capacity Reservation will end after the adjustment. Possible values are:
---@field CommitmentDuration? aws.ec2.BoxedLong The commitment duration, in seconds, that the Capacity Reservation will have after the adjustment.

---@alias aws.ec2.CapacityReservationAdjustmentStatus "requested"|"applied"|"rejected"

