---@field TrafficIpAddressType? aws.ec2.TrafficIpAddressType The IP address type of the Client VPN endpoint. Possible values are either ipv4 for IPv4 addressing only, ipv6 for IPv6 addressing only, or dual-stack for both IPv4 and IPv6 addressing.
