---@alias aws.ec2.InstanceTypeHypervisor "nitro"|"xen"

---Describes the instance type.
---@class aws.ec2.InstanceTypeInfo
---@field InstanceType? aws.ec2.InstanceType The instance type. For more information, see Instance types in the Amazon EC2 User Guide.
---@field CurrentGeneration? aws.ec2.CurrentGenerationFlag Indicates whether the instance type is current generation.
---@field FreeTierEligible? aws.ec2.FreeTierEligibleFlag Indicates whether the instance type is eligible for the free tier.
---@field SupportedUsageClasses? aws.ec2.UsageClassTypeList Indicates whether the instance type is offered for spot, On-Demand, or Capacity Blocks.
---@field SupportedRootDeviceTypes? aws.ec2.RootDeviceTypeList The supported root device types.
---@field SupportedVirtualizationTypes? aws.ec2.VirtualizationTypeList The supported virtualization types.
---@field BareMetal? aws.ec2.BareMetalFlag Indicates whether the instance is a bare metal instance type.
---@field Hypervisor? aws.ec2.InstanceTypeHypervisor The hypervisor for the instance type.
---@field ProcessorInfo? aws.ec2.ProcessorInfo Describes the processor.
---@field VCpuInfo? aws.ec2.VCpuInfo Describes the vCPU configurations for the instance type.
---@field MemoryInfo? aws.ec2.MemoryInfo Describes the memory for the instance type.
