---@field DefaultResourceDiscoveryId? aws.ec2.IpamResourceDiscoveryId The IPAM's default resource discovery ID.
---@field DefaultResourceDiscoveryAssociationId? aws.ec2.IpamResourceDiscoveryAssociationId The IPAM's default resource discovery association ID.
---@field ResourceDiscoveryAssociationCount? aws.ec2.Integer The IPAM's resource discovery association count.
---@field StateMessage? aws.ec2.String The state message.
