---@field IpamPoolId? aws.ec2.String The ID of the IPAM pool to match against. This condition selects CIDRs that belong to the specified IPAM pool.
---@field ResourceId? aws.ec2.String The ID of the Amazon Web Services resource to match against. This condition selects CIDRs associated with the specified resource.
---@field ResourceOwner? aws.ec2.String The Amazon Web Services account ID that owns the resources to match against. This condition selects CIDRs from resources owned by the specified account.
---@field ResourceRegion? aws.ec2.String The Amazon Web Services Region where the resources are located. This condition selects CIDRs from resources in the specified Region.
---@field ResourceTag? aws.ec2.IpamResourceTag A tag key-value pair to match against. This condition selects CIDRs from resources that have the specified tag.
---@field Cidr? aws.ec2.String A CIDR block to match against. This condition selects CIDRs that fall within or match the specified CIDR range.

