---@field NetmaskLength aws.ec2.Integer The netmask length of the CIDR you would like to allocate to the public IPv4 pool. The least specific netmask length you can define is 24.
---@field NetworkBorderGroup? aws.ec2.String The Availability Zone (AZ) or Local Zone (LZ) network border group that the resource that the IP address is assigned to is in. Defaults to an AZ network border group. For more information on available Local Zones, see Local Zone availability in the Amazon EC2 User Guide.

