---@field RootDeviceName? aws.ec2.String The device name of the root device volume (for example, /dev/sda1).
---@field BlockDeviceMappings? aws.ec2.BlockDeviceMappingRequestList The block device mapping entries.
---@field VirtualizationType? aws.ec2.String The type of virtualization (hvm | paravirtual).
---@field SriovNetSupport? aws.ec2.String Set to simple to enable enhanced networking with the Intel 82599 Virtual Function interface for the AMI and any instances that you launch from the AMI.
---@field EnaSupport? aws.ec2.Boolean Set to true to enable enhanced networking with ENA for the AMI and any instances that you launch from the AMI.

