---Information about an instance type to use in a Capacity Reservation Fleet.
---@class aws.ec2.ReservationFleetInstanceSpecification
---@field InstanceType? aws.ec2.InstanceType|string The instance type for which the Capacity Reservation Fleet reserves capacity.
