---@field Priority? aws.ec2.IntegerWithConstraints The priority to assign to the instance type. This value is used to determine which of the instance types specified for the Fleet should be prioritized for use. A lower value indicates a high priority. For more information, see Instance type priority in the Amazon EC2 User Guide.

