---@field UserData? aws.ec2.RunInstancesUserData|distilled.Secret The user data to make available to the instance. User data must be base64-encoded. Depending on the tool or SDK that you're using, the base64-encoding might be performed for you. For more information, see Run commands at launch using instance user data.
