---@field InstanceInitiatedShutdownBehavior? aws.ec2.ShutdownBehavior|string Indicates whether an instance stops or terminates when you initiate shutdown from the instance (using the operating system command for system shutdown).
---@field PrivateIpAddress? aws.ec2.String The primary IPv4 address. You must specify a value from the IPv4 address range of the subnet.
