---Describes a VPN connection.
---@class aws.ec2.VpnConnection
---@field Category? aws.ec2.String The category of the VPN connection. A value of VPN indicates an Amazon Web Services VPN connection. A value of VPN-Classic indicates an Amazon Web Services Classic VPN connection.
---@field TransitGatewayId? aws.ec2.String The ID of the transit gateway associated with the VPN connection.
---@field VpnConcentratorId? aws.ec2.String The ID of the VPN concentrator associated with the VPN connection.
---@field CoreNetworkArn? aws.ec2.String The ARN of the core network.
---@field CoreNetworkAttachmentArn? aws.ec2.String The ARN of the core network attachment.
---@field GatewayAssociationState? aws.ec2.GatewayAssociationState The current state of the gateway association.
---@field Options? aws.ec2.VpnConnectionOptions The VPN connection options.
---@field Routes? aws.ec2.VpnStaticRouteList The static routes associated with the VPN connection.
---@field Tags? aws.ec2.TagList Any tags assigned to the VPN connection.
---@field VgwTelemetry? aws.ec2.VgwTelemetryList Information about the VPN tunnel.
---@field PreSharedKeyArn? aws.ec2.String The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the Secrets Manager secret storing the pre-shared key(s) for the VPN connection.
---@field VpnConnectionId? aws.ec2.String The ID of the VPN connection.
---@field State? aws.ec2.VpnState The current state of the VPN connection.
