---@field Type? aws.ec2.GatewayType The type of VPN connection.
---@field CustomerGatewayId? aws.ec2.String The ID of the customer gateway at your end of the VPN connection.
---@field VpnGatewayId? aws.ec2.String The ID of the virtual private gateway at the Amazon Web Services side of the VPN connection.

